# Original synthetic console demonstration, 48000 Hz, 96000 frames (2 seconds).
# Upper B registration: 008000008; lower B: only 8-foot at eight.
# Nominal contacts; percussion initially On/Second/Normal/Fast; seed 0.
# A partial C4 speaks before its physical ninth-contact detector closes.
0 drawbar lower 2 8
0 key_position upper 60 0.5
# Full press starts shared decay; E4 and G4 join without resetting readiness.
5760 note_on upper 60 100
15360 note_on upper 64 100
23040 note_on upper 67 100
30720 note_off upper 60 0
34560 note_off upper 64 0
38400 note_off upper 67 0
# The lower C3 stays audible during upper-manual Cancel.
42240 note_on lower 48 100
48000 note_on upper 60 100
48000 note_on upper 64 100
48000 note_on upper 67 100
57600 cancel upper 0 0
63360 select_bank upper 0 1
# Disabling percussion restores the retained one-foot drawbar; enable masks it again.
71040 percussion upper 0 0
76800 percussion upper 0 1
84480 all_notes_off upper 0 0
86400 note_off lower 48 0
